1
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:21,730
Hei, tangkap dia!

2
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:51,843
BIASA

3
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,231
Di sini

4
00:01:06,066 --> 00:01:07,859
tak ada kamera pengawas, 'kan?

5
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:26,855
Lari!

6
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:50,211
Jo Anna?

7
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:03,349
Memang. Kalian berpikir
kekuatan super itu segalanya.

8
00:03:05,977 --> 00:03:09,480
Apa kalian melakukan
hal produktif dan membayar pajak?

9
00:03:10,607 --> 00:03:12,692
Di mana teman-temanmu?

10
00:03:14,277 --> 00:03:17,322
Kenapa membuatku repot berkali-kali?

11
00:03:25,788 --> 00:03:27,332
Kubakar kau hingga renyah.

12
00:03:36,299 --> 00:03:38,009
Kau tak lihat prediksi cuaca?

13
00:03:54,734 --> 00:03:56,027
Hujan.

14
00:03:59,739 --> 00:04:03,868
Kau tahu apa yang lebih kuat
daripada kekuatan super di zaman modern?

15
00:04:07,372 --> 00:04:08,748
Kemampuan.

16
00:04:11,209 --> 00:04:15,213
Itu benar. Itu disebut kekuatan super
bukan karena lebih unggul dari kemampuan.

17
00:04:19,342 --> 00:04:21,761
Bagaimana mengatakannya, ya?

18
00:04:23,763 --> 00:04:27,141
Ini mirip hubungan
pasta cabai dan pasta cabai asam.

19
00:04:28,309 --> 00:04:30,270
Atau lalat

20
00:04:31,145 --> 00:04:32,146
dan lalat buah?

21
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:35,775
Tidak. Intinya,

22
00:04:36,943 --> 00:04:38,069
aku kacau.

23
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:45,868
MENCARI ORANG

24
00:04:45,952 --> 00:04:50,915
LEE HWA-JIN, 23 TAHUN, TERAKHIR TERLIHAT
DI DEPAN STASIUN NAKSHIN, JONGNO

25
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:11,436
Sudah seminggu Hwa-jin tak ada kabar, ya?

26
00:05:11,936 --> 00:05:12,770
Ya.

27
00:05:19,944 --> 00:05:21,821
Roti-mi, kau harus belajar

28
00:05:21,904 --> 00:05:24,115
mengendalikan amarah di dalam hatimu.

29
00:05:24,615 --> 00:05:26,075
Aku sedang berusaha.

30
00:05:26,159 --> 00:05:27,410
Katanya, kau berdiet.

31
00:05:27,910 --> 00:05:31,122
Aku makan sehari sekali,
jadi, boleh makan sepuasnya.

32
00:05:31,205 --> 00:05:34,500
- Kita sudah makan malam tadi.
- Ini pencuci mulut.

33
00:05:34,584 --> 00:05:37,378
Kau juga minum alkohol tiap hari.

34
00:05:40,048 --> 00:05:41,174
- Apa ini?
- Ini.

35
00:05:41,257 --> 00:05:42,759
- Gila!
- Sudah lihat?

36
00:05:42,842 --> 00:05:44,969
Kalian lihat ini, Semuanya?

37
00:05:45,053 --> 00:05:46,304
Dia ceroboh.

38
00:05:46,387 --> 00:05:50,183
Dia menarik bus.
Dia Superman. Bukan, Spider-man!

39
00:05:50,266 --> 00:05:52,769
- Astaga.
- Sudah kuperbesar.

40
00:05:53,353 --> 00:05:55,188
Terangkat. Luar biasa!

41
00:05:55,271 --> 00:05:56,773
Dia ditangkap polisi.

42
00:05:58,066 --> 00:05:59,984
Aku menyaksikan kelahiran hero!

43
00:06:00,068 --> 00:06:03,071
Benda yang jatuh ini koin, 'kan?

44
00:06:03,905 --> 00:06:04,739
Benar.

45
00:06:04,822 --> 00:06:07,325
Semuanya, ini 100% nyata!

46
00:06:07,408 --> 00:06:10,495
- Ada yang begitu di antara kita?
- Dahulu.

47
00:06:16,584 --> 00:06:18,836
Ayo kita jemput dia. Kau…

48
00:06:19,921 --> 00:06:22,423
- Kau yang menyetir.
- Apa? Tidak bisa.

49
00:06:22,507 --> 00:06:24,384
Aku harus aplusan nanti.

50
00:06:25,301 --> 00:06:28,513
Banyak yang mengincarnya.
Kita harus temukan duluan.

51
00:06:28,596 --> 00:06:29,472
Tunggu!

52
00:06:30,431 --> 00:06:32,600
Hei, tunggu dulu.

53
00:06:33,101 --> 00:06:34,435
Kita bisa tertangkap.

54
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:38,606
Katamu, banyak yang mengincar.
Tak ada Hwa-jin. Jika salah langkah,

55
00:06:39,107 --> 00:06:41,401
kita tak sanggup berkelahi berdua.

56
00:06:41,484 --> 00:06:42,610
Roti-mi!

57
00:06:45,738 --> 00:06:47,073
Orang ini berbeda.

58
00:06:48,324 --> 00:06:50,410
Dia bisa menyelesaikan perkelahian.

59
00:06:59,669 --> 00:07:01,087
Matilah aku.

60
00:07:01,587 --> 00:07:03,381
Aku tak melakukan hal buruk,

61
00:07:04,173 --> 00:07:05,591
tetapi aku dipenjara.

62
00:07:06,342 --> 00:07:08,094
Dia pria bus itu, ya?

63
00:07:08,678 --> 00:07:10,513
Dia orang gila.

64
00:07:24,026 --> 00:07:24,861
Hei, Paman.

65
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:27,697
Katanya, kau mendorong bus?

66
00:07:29,782 --> 00:07:32,952
Aku? Tidak. Bukan aku.

67
00:07:34,162 --> 00:07:37,373
Bajingan. Kau benar-benar gila.

68
00:07:37,457 --> 00:07:39,375
- Coba dorong aku.
- Astaga.

69
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:40,793
Aku tidak mau…

70
00:07:43,379 --> 00:07:45,923
- Lihat. Aku tahu bukan dia.
- Kau lemah.

71
00:07:47,425 --> 00:07:48,926
Dia bukan apa-apa.

72
00:07:49,969 --> 00:07:51,554
Harap tenang!

73
00:07:52,972 --> 00:07:54,432
Aku diam. Sial.

74
00:07:57,226 --> 00:07:58,644
Aku ingin pulang.

75
00:08:00,062 --> 00:08:03,399
Aku ingin mandi,
bermain ponsel, lalu tidur.

76
00:08:05,234 --> 00:08:07,570
Aku ingin bekerja dengan aman besok.

77
00:08:07,653 --> 00:08:09,614
Astaga, aku berharap kerja?

78
00:08:12,492 --> 00:08:14,577
Tuhan, tolong aku.

79
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,955
Hubungi dia jika ada masalah.

80
00:08:23,252 --> 00:08:25,671
Apa yang dia lakukan? Dia kenapa?

81
00:08:26,172 --> 00:08:27,423
Dia lepas kendali.

82
00:08:27,924 --> 00:08:29,509
KETUA PARK JEONG-JA

83
00:08:29,592 --> 00:08:35,556
KREDIT JEONGJA

84
00:08:37,934 --> 00:08:40,144
- Halo.
- Oh. Ya.

85
00:08:40,645 --> 00:08:43,105
Halo, aku Kang Sang-ung.

86
00:08:43,606 --> 00:08:46,734
Ayahku menyuruh menghubungi nomormu

87
00:08:46,817 --> 00:08:49,946
jika ada masalah.

88
00:08:50,738 --> 00:08:52,657
Siapa nama ayahmu?

89
00:08:53,157 --> 00:08:56,786
Namanya Kang Dong-gi.

90
00:08:58,329 --> 00:09:00,581
Kang Dong-gi.

91
00:09:01,541 --> 00:09:02,833
GA SAMPAI KIM

92
00:09:04,752 --> 00:09:06,128
KANG DONG-GI

93
00:09:08,047 --> 00:09:09,340
DEBITUR KANG DONG-GI

94
00:09:13,594 --> 00:09:14,595
Ya.

95
00:09:16,055 --> 00:09:17,807
Bagaimana kabar ayahmu?

96
00:09:19,267 --> 00:09:20,810
RUANG TAHANAN

97
00:09:22,019 --> 00:09:23,062
Terima kasih.

98
00:09:28,818 --> 00:09:30,403
Ternyata ini berhasil.

99
00:09:37,118 --> 00:09:38,411
MIN-SUK (50)

100
00:09:39,996 --> 00:09:40,997
Matilah aku.

101
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:47,420
Paman, pahlawan kecelakaan bus
ada di sini, 'kan?

102
00:09:47,503 --> 00:09:49,755
- Aku lihat…
- Detektif!

103
00:09:49,839 --> 00:09:52,091
Aku akan jelaskan saat pengarahan.

104
00:09:52,174 --> 00:09:53,926
- Maaf.
- Tuan Kang!

105
00:09:54,010 --> 00:09:55,553
Tuan Kang Sang-ung.

106
00:10:05,062 --> 00:10:05,896
Ya, ampun.

107
00:10:10,359 --> 00:10:12,820
Kau telah melewati hal yang sulit.

108
00:10:17,491 --> 00:10:20,077
Maaf, kau siapa, ya?

109
00:10:26,334 --> 00:10:29,295
KREDIT JEONGJA

110
00:10:31,255 --> 00:10:33,841
- Bu Ketua, Tuan Kang sudah keluar.
- Bu Ketua?

111
00:10:36,260 --> 00:10:37,178
Selamat malam.

112
00:10:37,887 --> 00:10:39,138
Tak punya uang, 'kan?

113
00:10:39,847 --> 00:10:40,848
Apa?

114
00:10:40,931 --> 00:10:43,726
Naiklah. Aku antar pulang.

115
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:53,486
Kurasa, aku salah menghubunginya.

116
00:11:01,035 --> 00:11:02,370
Aku lihat beritanya.

117
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:06,707
Kau melakukan hal yang hebat.

118
00:11:06,791 --> 00:11:08,000
Aku bangga padamu.

119
00:11:09,168 --> 00:11:10,211
Namun,

120
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:14,006
kenapa kau bisa berpikir
meneleponku di tengah kekalutan?

121
00:11:15,174 --> 00:11:17,635
Pertama, terima kasih sudah menolongku.

122
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:21,889
Bahkan kau sopan.

123
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:26,769
Omong-omong,

124
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:32,149
kau pasti penasaran
bagaimana aku mengenal ayahmu, 'kan?

125
00:11:32,733 --> 00:11:35,111
Sejujurnya, aku tidak penasaran.

126
00:11:37,988 --> 00:11:41,450
Kak Dong-gi berutang kepadaku.

127
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:45,871
Orang yang baru kukenal
memanggil ayahku sebagai kakak

128
00:11:45,955 --> 00:11:48,124
dan membahas utang pribadi.

129
00:11:48,874 --> 00:11:51,794
Rasanya absurd.

130
00:11:51,877 --> 00:11:54,630
Sesuai aturan suku bunga maksimal,

131
00:11:55,131 --> 00:11:57,258
totalnya tiga miliar termasuk bunga.

132
00:11:58,718 --> 00:12:00,094
Pintunya…

133
00:12:24,869 --> 00:12:26,579
PETERNAKAN BEOMHA

134
00:12:39,633 --> 00:12:41,552
PETERNAKAN BEOMHA

135
00:12:55,441 --> 00:12:56,484
AREA TERBATAS

136
00:13:08,454 --> 00:13:09,747
DISETUJUI

137
00:13:27,556 --> 00:13:30,392
PRIA MENGANGKAT BUS JATUH,
MENCEGAH KORBAN JIWA

138
00:13:31,435 --> 00:13:33,020
Ayah akan menyukainya.

139
00:13:47,827 --> 00:13:49,995
SEDANG MENGEKSTRAKSI

140
00:13:50,079 --> 00:13:50,913
SELESAI

141
00:13:57,044 --> 00:13:58,254
Halo.

142
00:13:58,796 --> 00:14:01,173
Bagaimana rasanya jadi orang biasa lagi?

143
00:14:01,257 --> 00:14:02,675
Seperti lahir kembali?

144
00:14:03,175 --> 00:14:04,927
Berterimakasihlah padaku.

145
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:11,141
Dia mati?

146
00:14:11,642 --> 00:14:12,852
Tidak.

147
00:14:13,978 --> 00:14:15,896
Aduh, membosankan.

148
00:14:17,773 --> 00:14:19,775
Apa hebatnya ini semua?

149
00:14:31,579 --> 00:14:32,663
Ini cantik.

150
00:14:34,123 --> 00:14:37,042
- Apa yang terjadi jika disuntik padaku?
- Apa?

151
00:14:38,377 --> 00:14:39,587
Bawa.

152
00:14:43,549 --> 00:14:45,217
Uji klinisnya belum selesai…

153
00:14:52,933 --> 00:14:54,351
Dasar tidak becus.

154
00:14:59,148 --> 00:15:01,108
Pria bus itu miskin, 'kan?

155
00:15:01,191 --> 00:15:02,151
Ya, benar.

156
00:15:02,651 --> 00:15:05,905
Jika makin miskin,
dia tak akan bisa pakai kekuatan.

157
00:15:06,405 --> 00:15:09,241
- Perlu kublokir semua pendapatannya?
- Tak seru.

158
00:15:09,325 --> 00:15:11,076
Pada dasarnya, ini adu tipe.

159
00:15:12,119 --> 00:15:14,663
Uang tunai adalah kertas. Bakar saja.

160
00:15:15,915 --> 00:15:16,916
Oh, ya.

161
00:15:19,501 --> 00:15:21,670
Kita harus uji klinis, 'kan?

162
00:15:27,509 --> 00:15:28,594
Halo.

163
00:15:30,471 --> 00:15:32,014
Aku boleh minta tolong?

164
00:15:54,119 --> 00:15:54,954
Sial.

165
00:15:57,706 --> 00:15:58,582
Aduh.

166
00:16:00,376 --> 00:16:01,377
Kepalaku sakit.

167
00:16:22,064 --> 00:16:23,065
Maaf.

168
00:16:26,151 --> 00:16:27,444
Apa

169
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:30,906
yang sedang terjadi?

170
00:16:31,865 --> 00:16:34,326
Benarkah kau mewarisinya?

171
00:16:34,827 --> 00:16:36,996
Aku harus memastikannya sendiri.

172
00:16:39,748 --> 00:16:41,000
Mulai.

173
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:46,005
Seharusnya aku kooperatif
pada kebijakan dan diadili secara hukum.

174
00:17:01,562 --> 00:17:03,522
Saat dipukuli, aku berpikir.

175
00:17:05,899 --> 00:17:06,942
Kenapa Ayah

176
00:17:07,901 --> 00:17:10,070
menyuruhku menghubungi ke sini?

177
00:17:16,368 --> 00:17:17,453
- Hei.
- Hei.

178
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:19,538
- Hei!
- Dia kenapa?

179
00:17:20,372 --> 00:17:21,874
- Dia pingsan?
- Mati?

180
00:17:31,508 --> 00:17:33,343
Apa ini?

181
00:17:33,427 --> 00:17:35,888
- Uang apa?
- Apa ini?

182
00:17:38,599 --> 00:17:39,767
Apa-apaan ini?

183
00:18:06,293 --> 00:18:07,920
Aku menyadari dua hal.

184
00:18:08,921 --> 00:18:12,633
Pertama, rasanya sakit,
tapi tidak sampai mau mati.

185
00:18:17,596 --> 00:18:19,306
Itu berkat uang.

186
00:18:19,932 --> 00:18:22,851
Kedua, kalau uangnya habis,

187
00:18:23,936 --> 00:18:26,522
saat itulah aku benar-benar mati.

188
00:18:42,287 --> 00:18:43,122
Sial!

189
00:18:44,164 --> 00:18:45,040
Aduh!

190
00:18:47,417 --> 00:18:48,752
- Sial.
- Astaga.

191
00:18:58,262 --> 00:18:59,138
Rasakan!

192
00:19:18,407 --> 00:19:19,241
Wah.

193
00:19:20,117 --> 00:19:21,243
Oh!

194
00:19:22,911 --> 00:19:24,538
Mau apa?

195
00:19:25,873 --> 00:19:28,876
Apa lihat-lihat? Apa kau?

196
00:19:30,210 --> 00:19:31,628
Kau memukulku? Awas kau!

197
00:19:41,889 --> 00:19:44,641
Rasanya berat karena tak ada uang.

198
00:19:45,142 --> 00:19:46,143
Aku lelah.

199
00:19:46,935 --> 00:19:51,231
Dipikir-pikir,
aku selalu menderita dan lelah.

200
00:19:56,653 --> 00:19:57,863
Semuanya, keluar.

201
00:20:14,671 --> 00:20:16,340
Kau memang diwarisi.

202
00:20:17,466 --> 00:20:18,926
Kak Dong-gi apa kabar?

203
00:20:20,594 --> 00:20:21,762
Di Spanyol.

204
00:20:32,314 --> 00:20:33,523
Berlibur.

205
00:20:36,276 --> 00:20:39,029
Dia berlibur ke Spanyol
menggunakan uangku?

206
00:20:39,112 --> 00:20:40,739
Dengan wanita licik itu?

207
00:20:42,199 --> 00:20:44,326
Andai dia menikahiku sesuai janji,

208
00:20:44,409 --> 00:20:47,496
dia pasti sudah membeli
sebuah pulau di Spanyol.

209
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:53,377
Pokoknya, total utangnya jadi
3 miliar 5 juta won termasuk biaya tes.

210
00:20:54,253 --> 00:20:55,212
Lunasilah.

211
00:21:05,389 --> 00:21:08,267
Saat ini pun bunganya berjalan.

212
00:21:12,479 --> 00:21:14,064
Setelah kekuatan super sialan,

213
00:21:14,648 --> 00:21:19,903
aku mendapat warisan
utang tiga miliar pada pihak ketiga.

214
00:21:24,783 --> 00:21:25,784
Mohon maaf.

215
00:21:26,868 --> 00:21:29,913
Aku akan pulang
dan berdiskusi dengan ayahku…

216
00:21:29,997 --> 00:21:32,291
Diskusi apa? Begini saja.

217
00:21:33,834 --> 00:21:36,086
Nikahi putriku jika kau menyesal.

218
00:21:37,212 --> 00:21:40,173
- Ya?
- Maka, akan kuanggap utangmu lunas.

219
00:21:41,216 --> 00:21:43,552
Alurnya seperti sinetron.

220
00:21:44,052 --> 00:21:45,387
Jika jadi menantuku,

221
00:21:45,470 --> 00:21:47,681
kau tak akan kekurangan uang.

222
00:21:48,181 --> 00:21:50,350
Putriku sangat cantik, mirip aku.

223
00:21:51,518 --> 00:21:52,352
Oh.

224
00:21:53,854 --> 00:21:55,439
Kau pasti senang.

225
00:22:00,694 --> 00:22:01,653
Punya pacar, ya.

226
00:22:05,365 --> 00:22:08,327
Apa ini karena dia? Itu tidak bagus.

227
00:22:10,579 --> 00:22:11,580
Simaklah.

228
00:22:14,416 --> 00:22:16,501
Jika kau keluar seperti ini,

229
00:22:17,002 --> 00:22:19,046
kau tak akan bertahan 24 jam.

230
00:22:19,755 --> 00:22:22,174
Mereka tak akan diam setelah menangkapmu.

231
00:22:24,843 --> 00:22:28,764
- Mereka siapa?
- Kak Dong-gi tak bilang?

232
00:22:29,806 --> 00:22:32,392
Dia masih saja tak bertanggung jawab.

233
00:22:32,476 --> 00:22:37,105
Pokoknya, ada. Orang-orang gila
yang tak bisa kauatasi dengan gajimu.

234
00:22:38,732 --> 00:22:40,192
Makanya, jadi menantuku

235
00:22:41,193 --> 00:22:42,444
dan tinggal denganku.

236
00:22:44,988 --> 00:22:45,989
Apa maksudmu?

237
00:23:03,882 --> 00:23:04,883
Lantai tiga?

238
00:23:08,929 --> 00:23:11,056
Kira-kira sepuluh meter.

239
00:23:12,391 --> 00:23:13,642
Dua meter 10.000 won.

240
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:16,269
Uang 50.000 won.

241
00:23:28,698 --> 00:23:29,616
Hei!

242
00:23:35,038 --> 00:23:36,081
- Hei!
- Sial!

243
00:23:36,164 --> 00:23:38,917
- Kenapa mendorong?
- Tidak, aku memegangimu.

244
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,085
Biarkan saja.

245
00:23:55,475 --> 00:23:57,894
Dia akan kembali jika kehabisan uang.

246
00:24:24,129 --> 00:24:25,130
Wah.

